---
import Button from "../../shared/Button.astro";
import Badge from "../../shared/Badge.astro";
import { Sparkle } from "@lucide/astro";
import Container from "../../shared/Container.astro";
import ilustrationHeroRaw from "../../../../public/ilustration-hero.svg?raw";
import markiSuggestRaw from "../../../../public/marki-suggest.svg?raw";
---

<section class="w-full py-20 lg:py-32 md:min-h-screen md:flex md:flex-col md:justify-center bg-linear-to-b/decreasing from-surface-primary-light to-surface-background overflow-hidden">
  <Container class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-center justify-between relative z-10">
    <div
      class="self-stretch flex flex-col w-full lg:w-[55%] justify-start items-start gap-7 scroll-reveal"
    >
      <Badge variant="default" class="bg-surface-primary-light animate-pulse">
        <Sparkle class="h-4 w-4" />
        <span class="text-base font-medium"
          >Marki, tu amigo que sabe de marketing</span
        >
      </Badge>

      <h1
        class="xl:text-7xl md:text-6xl sm:w-full sm:text-6xl text-5xl font-bold text-primary-800 tracking-[-3px] leading-[1.05]"
      >
        Dejá de pensar  qué postear y 
        <span class="text-primary"
          >empezá a <span class="underline decoration-wavy">crecer</span></span
        >
      </h1>
      <p
        class="justify-center text-primary-700 lg:text-2xl md:text-xl text-lg w-full lg:w-[85%] font-medium leading-relaxed tracking-tight"
      >
        Marki te arma el calendario del mes: qué subir, cuando y por qué. Vos solo
        aprobás y publicás.<b class="font-bold"> Sin discursos complejos, sin perder horas frente a la
        pantalla</b> .
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 w-full">
        <Button
          type="rounded"
          variant="primary"
          data-open-demo
          class="shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform w-full sm:w-fit"
        >
          Agendar una demo
        </Button>
        <a
          type="rounded"
          class="shadow-sm inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold transition-all duration-100 ease-out gap-2 cursor-pointer  bg-white hover:bg-muted border border-border-default text-primary hover:bg-surface-subtle active:bg-surface-muted hover:scale-105  w-full sm:w-fit px-5 py-3 text-base rounded-full"
          href="#como-funciona"
        >
          Ver como funciona
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex w-full max-w-70 sm:max-w-lg lg:max-w-none lg:w-[40%] flex-col scroll-reveal delay-300 relative mt-8 lg:mt-0"
    >
      <div
        class="w-full self-start h-auto animate-float transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] hover:animate-none duration-500 [&>svg]:w-full [&>svg]:h-auto"
        role="img"
        aria-label="Generación de contenido de Marki"
        set:html={ilustrationHeroRaw}
      />
      <div
        class="w-[55%] self-end mt-[-22%] mr-[5%] z-10 h-auto animate-float-delayed transition-transform hover:-translate-y-2 hover:scale-[1.03] hover:animate-none duration-500 [&>svg]:w-full [&>svg]:h-auto"
        role="img"
        aria-label="Sugerencia de contenido de Marki"
        set:html={markiSuggestRaw}
      />
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
